  "notes": [
    "CONTENT MISMATCH: this is not a Consolidated Quarterly Report on Government Projects; it is the Bayanihan Grant to Cities and Municipalities \"Report on Fund Utilization and Status of Program/Project/Activity Implementation as of October 31, 2020\" (same format as the bayanihan series, e.g. 2020-q4-bayanihan-cities-november). Tables and column keys follow that series; the PPA table is keyed \"projects\" and has Received/Obligation/Disbursement instead of Total Cost/Cost Incurred.",
    "The period printed is as of October 31, 2020 (a monthly cut-off within Q4); year/quarter match the catalog.",
    "summary.utilized/obligated is the printed TOTAL Obligation (86,102,202.00); summary.disbursed is the printed TOTAL Disbursement (77,859,926.00). summary.grantAmount is the received grant (87,646,912.00), equal to the printed TOTAL Received. No balance is printed, so summary.balance is null. projectCount counts the PPA rows, including reverted/augmented lines without amounts. totalCost/costIncurred do not apply and are null.",
    "The printed TOTAL row sums the PPA rows only (Received 87,646,912.00 = sum of PPA Received); the NADAI grant line (table grant) is not added again.",
    "Page 5: one row is printed collapsed to a single line, truncated to \"Purchase of Eight (8)\" / \"Sta. Rosa\" / \"Emergency Purchase\" / \"3 sets - Sta Rosa\" (240,000.00 / 240,000.00 / 239,960.00, April to May 2020, 100% Implemented). The November 2020 report identifies it as Purchase of Eight (8) Sets of Mobile BP Apparatus; the label is kept as printed here.",
    "Mobile Exam Lights: Received 461,000.00, Obligation 460,800.00, Disbursement 460,760.00 with status \"Balance P240.00\" (461,000 - 460,760). Defibrillator status says \"Balance P160,000.00\" (9,600,000 - 9,440,000).",
    "Page 2 also prints the Augmentation (July 30, 2020, 1,843,750.00 from PPEs to Medical Supplies - Covid Related) and the SB No. 2020-04 allocations (Medical Supplies 17,000,000.00; Other MOE 3,000,000.00) as free-standing lines; they are in table adjustments.",
    "Page 8 holds only the signature block (Prepared by the Local Finance Committee; attested by the City Mayor)."
  ],
